{"_id":"WR1bphLHhdeoxNam","name":"Gymnophobia","type":"npc","img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-pf2e/art/gymnophobia.webp","items":[{"_id":"OKz5G6bXUAGN87DN","name":"Darkvision","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":800000,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Darkvision]</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"darkvision","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.qCCLZhnp2HhP3Ex6","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"p6WkVtSYGIQiDDEX","name":"Corpse Outfit (Hardness 15)","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":600000,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The gymnophobia wears a patchwork outfit made of various corpses and has Hardness. This Hardness reduces any damage it takes by an amount equal to the Hardness. Once the gymnophobia is reduced to less than half its Hit Points, or immediately upon being damaged by a critical hit, its patchwork outfit breaks, loses its Hardness, and its Armor Class is reduced to 24.</p>"},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","label":"Corpse Outfit broke by critical hit","domain":"all","option":"broken-outfit","toggleable":true,"value":false},{"key":"FlatModifier","selector":"ac","value":-4,"predicate":[{"or":["broken-outfit",{"lt":["hp-percent",50]}]}],"roll-options":["all"]}],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"4.7.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":1675727078152,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"CmkY8ry7nWxZVYUG","name":"Fear of Exposure","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":700000,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>If a gymnophobia's corpse outfit is destroyed, it becomes @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1}. Each round the gymnophobia knows it is observed by another creature, its frightened condition increases by 1 (to a maximum of @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 4}).</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"rue17vHLj7V3ncv8","name":"Reactive Grapple","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Reaction.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":212500,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature within the monster's reach uses a manipulate action or a move action, makes a ranged attack, or leaves a square during a move action it's using.</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The monster attempts a @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.PMbdMWc2QroouFGD]{Grapple} against the triggering creature.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"attack-of-opportunity","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.hFtNbo1LKYCoDy2O","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"F8ZslFTE9TK9ktCZ","name":"Meat Shield","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Reaction.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":200000,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<strong>Requirements</strong> The gymnophobia has a creature @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{Grabbed};\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> An enemy hits the gymnophobia with an attack;</p>\n\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The gymnophobia uses a creature it has grabbed to block the triggering attack. The gymnophobia gains a circumstance bonus to AC against the triggering attack. This bonus is +2 if the grabbed creature is Small, +3 if it is Medium, or +4 if it is Large or larger.</p>\n<p>If the difference in AC would cause the attack to miss, the attack instead hits the grabbed creature and damages that creature accordingly.</p>"},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","label":"Use Meat Shield (Small)","domain":"all","option":"meatShieldSmall","toggleable":true,"value":false},{"key":"FlatModifier","selector":"ac","value":2,"predicate":["meatShieldSmall"],"roll-options":["all"],"type":"circumstance","label":"Meat Shield (Small)"},{"key":"RollOption","label":"Use Meat Shield (Medium)","domain":"all","option":"meatShieldMedium","toggleable":true,"value":false},{"key":"FlatModifier","selector":"ac","value":3,"predicate":["meatShieldMedium"],"roll-options":["all"],"type":"circumstance","label":"Meat Shield (Medium)"},{"key":"RollOption","label":"Use Meat Shield (Large)","domain":"all","option":"meatShieldLarge","toggleable":true,"value":false},{"key":"FlatModifier","selector":"ac","value":4,"predicate":["meatShieldLarge"],"roll-options":["all"],"type":"circumstance","label":"Meat Shield (Large)"}],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"4.7.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":1675727079392,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"sMM7xfzrSAUtZyPc","name":"Patch Outfit","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":100000,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The gymnophobia is adjacent to the corpse of a Small or larger creature that died within the last hour;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The gymnophobia tears off pieces of the corpse and regains [[/r 20[healing]]]{20 Hit Points}. It can tear pieces from a Small corpse once, a Medium corpse twice, and a Large or larger corpse three times.</p>\n<p>If the gymnophobia's corpse outfit was broken and this ability restores the gymnophobia's current Hit Points to 80 or more, the gymnophobia's corpse outfit is restored, granting it Hardness 15, a +4 circumstance bonus to AC, and removing the frightened condition.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["manipulate"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":1},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"6ORt9gdJPwu2hRkc","name":"Jaws","type":"melee","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"value":"","gm":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["reach-15"],"otherTags":[]},"damageRolls":{"irvm0d0h9xs1pmxph4aa":{"damage":"2d10+13","damageType":"piercing","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":20},"attackEffects":{"value":["improved-grab"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":nu